#: mixedmaildirstore.cpp:1987 mixedmaildirstore.cpp:2011
#: mixedmaildirstore.cpp:2018 mixedmaildirstore.cpp:2097
#: mixedmaildirstore.cpp:2121
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:status"
